    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/37a689098d47818f8289e61ba302efe8.avif?t=1747213104\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/4ebbeff248b7632198d6fd4a560252ec.poster.avif?t=1747213104\" width=380 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/4ebbeff248b7632198d6fd4a560252ec.webm?t=1747213104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight robots by smoking in their faces! Inhale your magical substances and exhale smoke to attack, ignite it to deal more damage!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/5c7320e242854b4b929de778343a700a.avif?t=1747213104\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/15570d4ab138f69d615b74ffe45c4b7c.poster.avif?t=1747213104\" width=380 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/15570d4ab138f69d615b74ffe45c4b7c.webm?t=1747213104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGO has more than a lot of smoke particles, it lets you fight intense 1v100 battles! destroy thousands of robots and beat the best score!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/cdcf719f89019688c4ded4af2f174ad2.avif?t=1747213104\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/0177b98f03d31a9c9c1651ff29ea17f6.poster.avif?t=1747213104\" width=380 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/0177b98f03d31a9c9c1651ff29ea17f6.webm?t=1747213104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To beat the best score, you\u2019ll also have to master the high speed and versatile movement of the old wizard! Climb and fly by mastering the dash extend mechanic!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/47baaceac68f685f279c250d501ce445.avif?t=1747213104\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/d87ba681d1d0668b434d733c80ea981c.poster.avif?t=1747213104\" width=380 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/d87ba681d1d0668b434d733c80ea981c.webm?t=1747213104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As movement and smoke fight mechanics mix, find the most efficient way to the Bus! Speedrun an array of open-ended levels and become the best smoking wizard!</strong> \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/f0030409158b1a87b8df135d36cf322f.avif?t=1747213104\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/f70fedf5178bf9397a108602bce1abda.poster.avif?t=1747213104\" width=380 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692680/extras/f70fedf5178bf9397a108602bce1abda.webm?t=1747213104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After destroying a whole industry line of robots, EGO lets you destroy unique and gigantic robots!</strong></p>",
